s called ImageNet. There are different types of CNNs that have different structures (architectures) that work better or worse depending on your criteria. With this project you'll explore the three different architectures (AlexNet, VGG, and ResNet).","topics":[],"score":250726,"global_rank":60301,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":10994},{"name":"nc-uw/Arbitrage---Reinforcement-Learning","owner":"nc-uw","html_url":"https://github.com/nc-uw/Arbitrage---Reinforcement-Learning","stars":2,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Arbitrage in Energy Storage devices using Cross Entropy method","topics":[],"score":250722,"global_rank":60306,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":10995},{"name":"rocket3989/ieeextreme14","owner":"rocket3989","html_url":"https://github.com/rocket3989/ieeextreme14","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"CUC Bat Knights' Solutions for ieeextreme 14","topics":[],"score":250722,"global_rank":60316,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":10996},{"name":"TheNeuralBit/task-gmail-sync","owner":"TheNeuralBit","html_url":"https://github.com/TheNeuralBit/task-gmail-sync","stars":1,"forks":1,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Python script for synchronizing a gmail label and taskwarrior tasks","topics":[],"score":250718,"global_rank":60328,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":10997},{"name":"adriandahlin/fitness","owner":"adriandahlin","html_url":"https://github.com/adriandahlin/fitness","stars":2,"forks":2,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"an app for logging and viewing my fitness data","topics":[],"score":250712,"global_rank":60331,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":10998},{"name":"Brobz/8queen_annealing","owner":"Brobz","html_url":"https://github.com/Brobz/8queen_annealing","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A python/curses visualization of the S